    "intro": {
      "zh": "Nintendo 64 是任天堂 1996 年发布的 64 位家用游戏机，在光盘世代逆流而上坚持卡带介质，却凭借《超级马力欧 64》等第一方大作确立了 3D 平台游戏的范式，并首次引入模拟摇杆，重新定义了 3D 游戏的操作方式。它是游戏机厅第五代主机中「卡带 3D 教科书」的独特存在。",
      "en": "The Nintendo 64, released by Nintendo in 1996, was a 64-bit home console that held to cartridge media against the optical-disc tide, yet established the 3D platformer paradigm with first-party titles like Super Mario 64 and introduced the analog stick, redefining 3D game controls."
    },
    "era": 1996,
    "manufacturer": "Nintendo"
  },
